1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,283
Larger changes alter the structure of whole chromosomes.

2
00:00:04,283 --> 00:00:07,643
Take a chromosome with segments A to G.

3
00:00:07,643 --> 00:00:09,791
A deletion loses a piece.

4
00:00:09,791 --> 00:00:12,304
A duplication repeats a piece.

5
00:00:12,304 --> 00:00:15,234
An inversion turns a piece end to end.

6
00:00:15,234 --> 00:00:20,898
And a translocation moves a piece onto a different, non homologous chromosome.

